# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This example is HARDCODED for mainnet-beta — see lib/env.ts and next.config.ts.
# You do NOT need an .env file to run it. `pnpm dev` works out of the box against
# the public mainnet RPC.
#
# OPTIONAL: the public mainnet RPC rate-limits under load. To use a paid endpoint
# (Helius / Triton / QuickNode) for reliable scans + deposits, copy this file to
# .env.local and set your RPC URL. .env.local is gitignored.
#
# ⚠️ This is a NEXT_PUBLIC (browser-exposed) var. Fine for local testing; do not
# ship a public build with a real key inlined — proxy the RPC server-side first.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# NEXT_PUBLIC_RPC_URL=https://mainnet.helius-rpc.com/?api-key=YOUR_KEY
# NEXT_PUBLIC_RPC_WS_URL=wss://mainnet.helius-rpc.com/?api-key=YOUR_KEY

# OPTIONAL: switch network without touching code. Defaults to mainnet.
# Set to "devnet" to retarget everything (mint, indexer, relayer all follow).
# When you switch to devnet, also set the RPC above to a devnet endpoint.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_NETWORK=devnet

# OPTIONAL: debug logging + in-app DebugPanel. OFF by default (clean console).
# Set to 1 to turn on while troubleshooting.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_UMBRA_DEBUG=1
